      "start": -3000,
      "details": "<p>According to the Sumerian King List, Ke\u0161 was the first city to have kings after the Deluge. The present location of the ancient city is unknown and some scholars have suggested <span>Tell Wilaya as a possible location; Tell\u00a0<span>Abu Salabikh is another likely candidate for\u00a0<span>Ke\u0161. T</span></span></span>here is no archaeological or textual evidence to confirm either proposal.</p>",
      "review_state": "published",
      "description": "Ke\u0161 is a presently unlocated Sumerian and Babylonian city. ",
      "transcriptionCompleteness": "complete",
      "language": "sux",
